[Daily Menu Population](/C:/Users/yashp/cs320-project/.github/workflows/daily-populate.yml) is scheduled for **12:05 a.m. Eastern every day**, including daylight saving time. It also supports manual runs from the Actions tab.

The workflow calls `dailyPopulate()` in [dailyPopulation.ts](/C:/Users/yashp/cs320-project/BackEnd/src/db/dailyPopulation.ts). Each location uses its configured target date of 13, 7, or 6 days ahead, calculated from the Eastern calendar date.

To activate it, add `SUPABASE_URL` and a write-capable `SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY` as GitHub Actions repository secrets and merge the changes to the default branch. [GitHub scheduled workflow docs](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/reference/workflows-and-actions/events-that-trigger-workflows#schedule)

